    answer: '- `StateFlow`: mandatory initial value, replays the latest, skips duplicate emissions\n- `SharedFlow`: no current value; `replay = N`, equality unchecked\n- UI state (`isLoading`, lists) → StateFlow; nav/toast/analytics events → SharedFlow'
